r shaped portion of focally cauterized tan yellow and blue unoriented portion of fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes I K  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast final shaved margin  medial half of cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm irregular shaped portion of tan yellow  focally cauterized  unoriented adipose tissue  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes L M  Resident  TRACY L  DAVIS  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  LYMPH NODE LEFT SENTINEL  EXCISION PART C  BREAST LEFT FINAL LATERAL MARGIN  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT FINAL MEDIAL MARGIN  EXCISION , Pathologic_size.
