el reveals a single 1 9cm tan red lymph node  The lymph nodes are entirely submitted as follows  G  Highest lymph node bisected H  Five whole lymph nodes from the highest level I  One lymph nodes bisected from the highest level J  Five whole lymph nodes from the mid level K  One lymph node bisected from the mid level L  Three whole lymph nodes from mid level M  Two whole lymph nodes from mid level N  One whole lymph node bisected from the lowest level Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  inferior lateral final shaved margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  the specimen is entirely submitted as O S  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  superior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm portion of unremarkable tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as T  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  JOHN BISSONNETTE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Sarah P Thayer  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   DISSECTION PART B  BREAST  INFERIOR LATERAL   FINAL SHAVED MARGIN PART C  BREAST  SUPERIOR   MARGIN PART D  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Pathologic_size.
